    "pages.info.7": "Favorites, planning details and the plans you chose to save are stored in the browser on this device. If you turned on draft backup, days and requests being edited are also stored locally; turning the backup off deletes the backup copies but not the plans you saved. Without an account, there is no cloud sync.",
    "pages.info.8": "Customer account (optional)",
    "pages.info.9": "You can open an account to save trips, flights and favorites and continue from any device. The account stores: name, email, phone (optional), marketing consent (only if you ticked it, with the date and wording), your saved items, up to 20 recent flight searches (route, dates and travelers, without prices) and a summary of requests you sent (type, date, destination; without the message content). The password is stored only as a one-way hash, and your sign-in is kept in a single secure cookie. There is no legal obligation to provide these details; without them an account can’t be opened. Access is limited to Gerbi Tours, and the information is not shared with others. At any time, in your personal area, you can review your information and download a full copy, correct details, unsubscribe from marketing and delete the account. Requests you sent are kept by the team for handling, and you can ask us to delete them.",
    "pages.info.10": "Request processing and usage data",
    "pages.info.11": "Your planner request is sent to the local server and processed by rules. Some usage actions are sent to the local server to aggregate matching data. With consent to learning, keywords, tags and a hashed identifier are also stored; the original request text is not stored in the learning database. When the rules understand only a small part of a request, or when two leading flights are nearly equal, the server may send a language model provider (Anthropic) the request text only, after removing phone numbers and emails, or a shortened table of prices and times. No name, identifier or history is sent. To improve ranking, aggregate statistics of choices are also kept by a hashed signature of the search type (destination, month, group type), with no text and no user identifier. A draft request on the help page is not sent. Details you leave in the contact form or the tailor-made trip form (name, phone, email, trip details and the consent you gave) are sent to the server and stored so a Gerbi Tours agent can get back to you; access is limited to the site owners, and you can ask to review or delete them. There is no payment and no passenger details are passed to a supplier in this version.",
    "pages.info.12": "External services",
    "pages.info.13": "The font is loaded from Google Fonts. Images are served locally. Flight search and price checks send the route, dates and travelers through our server to the flight suppliers we work with. All service comes from us, Gerbi Tours. Preferences stay on the device, and saved trips stay on the device unless you signed in to an account.",
    "pages.info.14": "How do I keep a copy?",
    "pages.info.15": "You can download a plan from the trip page. Clearing browser data may remove information you saved. This is an explanation of the prototype, not a policy for an active commercial service.",
    "pages.info.16": "Keyboard navigation",
    "pages.info.17": "Move between links and buttons with Tab, activate them with Enter and close a dialog with Escape. A “Skip to content” link is at the top of the page.",
    "pages.info.18": "Reading and display",
    "pages.info.19": "The site supports Hebrew right-to-left and English left-to-right, different screen sizes, field labels and reduced motion according to your device settings.",
    "pages.info.20": "Accessibility requests for your holiday",
    "pages.info.21": "You can add requests for adjustments on the planning screen. Every adjustment at a hotel, on a flight or in an activity needs separate checking and confirmation.",
    "pages.info.22": "Testing status",
    "pages.info.23": "Main flows and responsive screens have been tested. A full professional accessibility audit or certification to the standard has not yet been carried out.",
    "pages.info.24": "Questions and help",
